     1	"""CP-8 — AI.10 NFR harness (``scripts/run_nfr_harness.py``): T-NFR-004 is an
     2	asserted in-process law (2000 P0 delivered, P2 evicted under lane pressure,
     3	lane never exceeding the governed 1000); T-NFR-001..003 are measured and
     4	labelled SANDBOX-PARTIAL / OWNER-VERIFY so no target-device result is ever
     5	claimed (AI.10 rule 5 / AI.13)."""
